meta {
  name: 04 - Needs More Info (Missing Credit Score)
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

post {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/loan/prequalify
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "description": "I want to borrow $50,000 for a home renovation. I make decent money."
  }
}

docs {
  Deliberately vague description. extractedApplication.creditScore should
  come back null (NOT a guessed number - this is the real proof extraction
  isn't hallucinating values it wasn't told).

  Rules engine should catch the missing credit score (and likely missing
  employment status too) -> decision.decision = "NEEDS_MORE_INFO", listing
  exactly which fields are missing. Should also never reach the gRPC risk
  scorer, same as the rejection case.
}
